					"Vassal of the Clan", "Vengeful", "Venomous Bite", "Victim of the Masquerade", "Vitae Sink", "Vulgar",
					"Vulnerability (1)", "Vulnerability (2)", "Vulnerability (3)", "Vulnerability (4)", "Vulnerability (5)",
