					"Axe (Werewolf)", "Barbed Cat", "Baseball Bat", "Battle-Ax", "Bear Mace", "Biggs Mjollner Mk. IV",
					"Biggs X-5 Model A Protector", "Biggs X-5 Model R Protector", "Bite", "Bite (Mage)", "Blinding",
