					"Sai", "Sap", "Sap (Mage)", "Sap (Werewolf)", "Semi-Automatic Pistol, Hvy.",
					"Semi-Automatic Pistol, Lt.", "Short Bow", "Short Sword", "Shortbow", "Shotgun", "Shotgun, Assault",
					"Shotgun, Sawed Off", "Shotgun, Semi-auto", "Shotgun, Semi-Automatic", "Shuriken", "Sling",
