			-- ADVANCED_DISC is the sixth-to-ninth dot of a Discipline: elder powers, one entry per
			-- power as {level, name}, from the core Disciplines chapter plus its bloodline chapter
			-- and from Dark Ages p. 188 onward. Levels 6..9 by definition - the fifth dot and below
			-- is the ordinary ladder and is not repeated here. The sheet still draws five dots per
			-- Discipline row; this table does not ask it to draw more.
